- **`exclusions.json`** — west back-of-house band (60×220 pt with zero fixtures and zero product labels, fenced from the floor by the deli-alcove wall, two drawn swing doors at x 121–129, the Tortilleria walls, the sawtooth case and the bakery wall); the walled back room west of Produce (door swing in its south wall); the Pharmacy dispensary traced from the counter strokes; the north-wall receiving-door recess; the Sushiya kiosk roundel the raster pass missed.
- **`inclusions.json`** — the north service-case frontage (the Deli/Seafood/Market cases are the thin band against the top wall, so the floor carrying those titles is shopping aisle) and the Pharmacy waiting corridor + pickup recess. Both also clear the VERIFY flags.
